-- Cosmographer drew far too many Chinese dynasties for a player who knows only the famous ones. Of the twelve in the
-- bank only the four best known are kept: Yuan, Qing, Ming and Tang. The eight removed on 2026-10-19 are Eastern Han,
-- Western Han, Northern Yuan, Xin, Northern Song, Qin, Shang and Xia (130 countries -> 122). None of them was in a
-- daily quiz for 2026-10-19 (the day's set had not been created yet), so no round in progress was affected; older
-- days only keep their ids in daily_quizzes/quiz_progress history, which nothing reads back.
delete from public.territory_compare_items
where id in ('territory_014', 'territory_019', 'territory_025', 'territory_027', 'territory_050', 'territory_070', 'territory_100', 'territory_145');

